      "bars": 8,
      "bpm": 104,
      "loop": true,
      "transpose": 2,
      "_comment": "Home and triumph (the close), lifted a whole step (transpose +2) for the apotheosis: brass and choir sing the full hero_theme in radiant major, a flute descant soars its answer an octave up, trumpet crowns with the fanfare, a two-octave harp arp shimmers, taiko and timpani carry it out on a bright plagal cadence.",
